<title>USA: Homestyle Harmony sets reverse split.</title>
<headline>Homestyle Harmony sets reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>SARASOTA, Fla. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Homestyle Harmony Inc said on Tuesday after the market closed that the company has reverse split its stock one for ten, resulting in 6.8 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said it has officially changed its public name to Homestyle Harmony from Aire Wrap Systems International Inc.</p>
</text>
